# Local dry runs only. Copy this file to .env.submit and replace every placeholder.
# Never commit .env.submit. GitHub Actions reads matching credentials from the
# protected browser-stores environment instead.
# Chrome service accounts must be granted publisher access in the Chrome Web Store dashboard.
